## 6. FLUX COMPLET (entrée → stockage → rendu)

VIDÉO :
1. drop/capture in-app → `captureFiles` → `routeFile` → `captureVideoServerHls` → POST brut `/api/transcode-local`.
2. serveur (`hls-cli.js`) lance `Scripts/video-hls.mjs` → `transcodeHls` (ffmpeg, AES-128, .ts, poster) → `pushHls` (segments SHA→jsDelivr public, playlists+clé+manifeste→zenray-data privé). SSE de progression.
3. arbre rafraîchi → nœud `.media.json {type:'hls'}` visible, `MediaIcon` affiche le poster.
4. ouverture → `MediaViewer` → `readManifest` → `HlsVideo(master=/api/hls?path=…)` → hls.js fetch master (`/api/hls`) → media playlists → segments jsDelivr@SHA → clé (`/api/hls-key`, gate Origin) → lecture.

AUDIO : `routeFile` → `captureAudio` → chunks AES-GCM (public chiffré) + `.media.json {type:'chunked-media'}` + index `audio/manifest.json`. Rendu : `<audio>/api/stream` (Finder) ou onglet Audio (PlayerContext). PDF : `captureBinaryMedia` → chunks → `.media.json` → iframe `/api/stream`.

